  "body": "**Suggestion**\r\nThe Matrix Spec does not currently use [semver](https://semver.org/) for its versions. Semver is standardized, well-understood, and widely adopted in many FOSS projects. Matrix should adopt and migrate to semantic versioning in all locations where versioning is used.",
